ted. [RESULT] A\n   - Response B: The repeated suggestion of physical therapy and missing details in the explanation about further steps reduce the support for evidence-based practice. [RESULT] A\n\nOverall, based on the score rubric, Response A outperforms Response B in all evaluated criteria. Response A is the better choice.", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1734277998, "model": "gpt-4o-2024-08-06", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_9faba9f038", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 428, "prompt_tokens": 6293, "total_tokens": 6721, "completion_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0}}}


